[[2047,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"dismantling\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Dismantling</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"reassembling\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Reassembling</a><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238467\">5540D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238373\">5050D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Release the air intake grille retaining clips.</p><p>2. Remove the air intake grille.</p><p>3. Release the fog lamp wiring from the retainers.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019580.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"reassembling\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Reassembling</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"dismantling\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Dismantling</a><p>Check that the parts to be refitted are\nundamaged.</p><p>Position the wiring for the fog lights\nand engage it on the retainers.</p><p>Position the air intake grille and engage\nthe retaining springs.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238373\">5050D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238467\">5540D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"dismantling\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Dismantling</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"reassembling\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Reassembling</a><p><a href=\"#/3238950\">7055A40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238467\">5540D10</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238958\">7055B08</a></p><p>1. Remove the fog lights wiring (1a) releasing it from the retainers\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070115.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"reassembling\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Reassembling</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"dismantling\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Dismantling</a><p>Check that the parts are not damaged.</p><p>Position the wiring and attach the retainers.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238958\">7055B08</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238467\">5540D10</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238950\">7055A40</a></p>"]]